# Frontend Rules

## Access UX

- Render FREE / PREMIUM / BUY / WATCH AD / LOCKED from server AccessDecision
- Never gate screens with local `isPremium` as authority
- Explain rewarded unlock duration/limits before showing ads
- No dark patterns hiding price/terms

## Engineering

- Use Shared API client + error model
- Use Design System components; do not fork casually
- Paginate lists; lazy-load heavy media
- Mobile-first layouts for student surfaces

## Performance

- Avoid blocking render on analytics
- Prefer progressive enhancement for player/reader
